iant_female_record_index":"161493","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1410612005":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、なんか言ってやった方がいいかな……？","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，这样不行吧？他一直这么憋着……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB00172DB82A5DDB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、なんか言ってやった方がいいかな……？","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、なんか言ってやった方がいいかな……？","variant_male_record_index":"161492","variant_female_record_index":"161493","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410612006:1":{"text":"オレが得意そうに見えるか？","source_cn":"我看着像很懂的样子吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x77AB42302A72CAC8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"オレが得意そうに見えるか？","female":"オレが得意そうに見えるか？","variant_male_record_index":"161494","variant_female_record_index":"161495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410612009:1":{"text":"衛兵になったばかりの頃、私は厄化人を討つことに迷いがあった。","source_cn":"刚成为卫兵时，我对孽化者下手总是会犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81DC5F41F5DB1BF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410612010:1":{"text":"そんな私にフェリルは、躊躇してはだめだと、それでは自分が傷付いてしまうと言ってくれた……","source_cn":"斐利尔会说我太过谨慎，应该更果断一些……不然自己容易受伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8151EE201CF740","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410612011:1":{"text":"自分を守る方法、傷の手当て、信念を貫く姿勢……フェリルは、私に多くのことを教えてくれた……","source_cn":"他教我保护自己，治愈伤痛，坚守信念……斐利尔教会了我那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2C15F9D29B2174","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410612012:1":{"text":"だが……無二の友を失う苦しみと向き合う方法は、教えてくれなかった。","source_cn":"却从来没有教过我……该如何面对失去挚友的痛苦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C94DB82C5CE876E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410612013:1":{"text":"ときには、思いっきり泣いた方が楽になることもある。","source_cn":"唉，小子……有时候痛哭一场，比装作若无其事更好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x748423237D9A8DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410612014:1":{"text":"いや……フェリルが命と引き換えに教えてくれた真相がこの先にあるのだ。","source_cn":"不……至少现在不能。斐利尔用生命换来的真相就在前方——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F82E5A4569DCC7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410612015:1":{"text":"その答えを見つけるまで、悲しむことは許されない。","source_cn":"在找到答案之前，我决不允许自己悲伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E839F720E735889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1410612015":{"text":"その答えを見つけるまで、悲しむことは許されない。","source_cn":"在找到答案之前，我决不允许自己悲伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E839F720E735889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410612016:1":{"text":"……ありがとう。私は大丈夫だ。これからどこへ向かえばいい？","source_cn":"……谢谢，我没事。接下来要去哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49FD68E98CB82868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410612017:0":{"text":"やっぱり当てもなく歩いてただけだったのかよ！ったく、ここはガキンチョに免じて――","source_cn":"……原来你就是在闷头乱走！唉，看在祭司小子的面上——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7233628908CD7A4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410612018:1":{"text":"行くぞ、フェリルが目にした真相ってやつを見せてやる。","source_cn":"走吧，我带你去见见斐利尔见到的真相。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B4AB006BC1EEA46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"（インドラの肩を叩く）","source_cn":"（拍拍他的肩膀）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4139FF9222BD85AF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（インドラの肩を叩く）","female":"（インドラの肩を叩く）","variant_male_record_index":"72024","variant_female_record_index":"72025","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:1:2":{"text":"（インドラの手を握る）","source_cn":"（握住他的手）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x62BCD57D0A0B05